// Title: OS Architecture Discovery Via Grep
// ID: d27ab432-2199-483f-a297-03633c05bae6
// Status: test
// Level: low
// Author: Joseliyo Sanchez, @Joseliyo_Jstnk
// Date: 2023-06-02
// Tags: attack.discovery, attack.t1082
// Description: Detects the use of grep to identify information about the operating system architecture. Often combined beforehand with the execution of "uname" or "cat /proc/cpuinfo"
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((where(CommandLine IENDSWITH "aarch64") OR where(CommandLine IENDSWITH "arm") OR where(CommandLine IENDSWITH "i386") OR where(CommandLine IENDSWITH "i686") OR where(CommandLine IENDSWITH "mips") OR where(CommandLine IENDSWITH "x86_64"))) AND (where(Image IENDSWITH "/grep")))
